A `true`/`false` value is written unquoted, so a reader loads it as a boolean.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md blocked=true reviewed=false
-- exit --
0
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: blocked=true, reviewed=false
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
blocked: true
reviewed: false
---
# Body
